# Review packages are regenerated from git on demand and duplicate content already in
# history. Everything else in a plan workspace is tracked: the ledger records every
# review finding, ruling and deferred item, and the briefs and reports record why each
# commit looks the way it does.
#
# NOTE: the superpowers review-package script rewrites this file to a bare "*" each time
# it runs, which would silently untrack everything here. Restore this content if that happens.
review-*.diff
